        "text": "=The company I want to research is {{$json.company_name}}.\n\nUse web search to find only the latest reported quarterly or annual financial results for this company.\n\nReturn only:\n\n1. Reporting period\n2. Revenue\n3. Revenue growth\n4. Net income\n5. Source\n6. Publication date\n\nPrefer the company's investor relations or official earnings release.\n\nDo not search broadly.\nDo not add commentary.\nDo not analyze risks yet.",
