    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=The company I want to research is {{$json.company_name}}.\n\nUse web search to identify the company's current senior leadership.\n\nReturn only:\n\n1. CEO - name and tenure/start date\n2. CFO - name and tenure/start date\n3. One other senior executive important to the company's current strategy\n4. Any major CEO or CFO leadership change announced in the last 12 months\n5. Source\n6. Publication date\n\nPrefer the company's official leadership pages, investor relations pages,\nregulatory filings or official announcements.\n\nDo not search broadly.\nDo not speculate.\nIf information cannot be verified, say \"Not verified\".",
