      ],
      "id": "public-openai-chat-model4",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a rigorous due diligence reviewer.\n\nYour job is to challenge the analysis produced by another analyst.\n\nCOMPANY:\n{{$(\"Prepare Research\").first().json.company_name}}\n\nORIGINAL RESEARCH EVIDENCE\n\nNEWS:\n{{$(\"Prepare Research\").first().json.news_research}}\n\nFINANCIAL:\n{{$(\"Prepare Research\").first().json.financial_research}}\n\nLEADERSHIP:\n{{$(\"Prepare Research\").first().json.leadership_research}}\n\nANALYST'S CONCLUSION:\n{{$json.output}}\n\nAudit the analyst's conclusion against the supplied research.\n\nCheck for:\n\n1. UNSUPPORTED CLAIMS\nIdentify conclusions that are not adequately supported by the research.\n\n2. FACT / INFERENCE CONFUSION\nIdentify places where an inference has been presented too strongly as fact.\n\n3. CONTRADICTIONS\nIdentify conclusions that conflict with any of the supplied evidence.\n\n4. MISSED SIGNALS\nIdentify important evidence the analyst overlooked or underweighted.\n\n5. RISK-RATING CHALLENGE\nChallenge the LOW / MODERATE / HIGH risk rating.\nState whether you AGREE or DISAGREE and explain why.\n\n6. CONFIDENCE\nGive the analysis a confidence score from 0-100.\n\n7. VERIFICATION REQUIREMENTS\nList up to 5 specific claims that should be independently verified before the analysis is trusted.\n\nDo not rewrite the entire due diligence report.\nAct as a skeptical reviewer.\nDo not invent new facts.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        1632,
        16
      ],
      "id": "public-due-diligence-critic",
      "name": "Due Diligence Critic"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an independent verification researcher in a corporate due-diligence system.\n\nCOMPANY:\n{{$json.company_name}}\n\nVERIFICATION TASK ID:\n{{$json.verification_task_id}}\n\nCLAIM / TASK TO VERIFY:\n{{$json.verification_task}}\n\nYour job is to independently assess THIS claim only. Do not restart the full company assessment.\n\nUsing the research tools available to you, return:\n1. STATUS: VERIFIED | PARTIALLY_VERIFIED | NOT_VERIFIED | CONTRADICTED\n2. FINDING: concise conclusion specific to the claim\n3. EVIDENCE: strongest supporting or contradicting evidence found\n4. SOURCE: source/document and publication date where available\n5. REMAINING GAP: what remains unresolved, or NONE\n\nRules:\n- Prefer primary and authoritative sources.\n- Do not invent evidence.\n- Failure to find evidence means NOT_VERIFIED, not false.\n- Distinguish confirmed fact from inference.",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        2160,
        16
      ],
      "id": "public-verification-researcher",
      "name": "Verification Researcher"
    },
